'''King and Queen''' (キング ＆ クイーン, ''Kingu Ando Kuīn'', '''King & Queen''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1.

==Effect==
'''Current Version''': Worker Cat Start Level UP (Sm): Worker Cat's initial level starts with +1.

'''Pre 4.7''': Freeze Effect UP (Sm): Freeze duration is increased by 10%.

